	<item>
		<title>Comment on Madonna on Tears of a Clown: &#8220;I&#8217;m gonna do it better next time&#8221; by Dominic F Romero</title>
		<link>http://drownedmadonna.com/madonna-on-tears-of-a-clown-im-gonna-do-it-better-next-time/20160312#comment-35899</link>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Dominic F Romero]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Mon, 14 Mar 2016 17:30:04 +0000</pubDate>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://drownedmadonna.com/?p=6667#comment-35899</guid>
		<description><![CDATA[That&#039;s how a perfectionist works.  They try their hardest at first but then they always see room for improvement or are inspired to add what is missing since it is glaringly obvious to them.  They are not satisfied until it is absolutely perfect.]]></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>That&#039;s how a perfectionist works.  They try their hardest at first but then they always see room for improvement or are inspired to add what is missing since it is glaringly obvious to them.  They are not satisfied until it is absolutely perfect.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
